      "user": {
        "title": "Calendrier Tempo EDF",
        "description": "Adds the EDF Tempo color of today and tomorrow (official EDF colors), forecasts up to 15 days ahead (D+2 to D+5: most reliable range; D+6 to D+15: indicative trend), a calendar of white and red days, the next red and white day and the remaining days, from the free public API of calendrier-tempo.fr. No account or key required. Only the color published by EDF is authoritative."
      }
